cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.

title: "py-motmetrics: Metrics for multiple object tracker benchmarking"

abstract: >-
  py-motmetrics is a Python library for evaluating multiple-object
  tracking results. It provides MOTChallenge-aligned CLEAR MOT,
  Identity, and HOTA metrics, including sequence-level parallel
  evaluation.

authors:
